{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ん～～～～～！ななせまる！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanase.nishino/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/21/8770622/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沖縄でそーきそば食べたとき！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"聞いて聞いて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"健康とか肌とかの為に苦手な野菜ジュースを飲み始めました(　・´ｰ・｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも飲み始めたからといって好きになれるわけではなかったー故に今だにあの味は苦手だよ！好きになりたい気持ちは確かにここにあるのにくっそー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ！今日の朝が涼しすぎてびっくりしました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いいですねー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱり、1日かけて考えた結果...わたしは秋と冬と春はじめが好きです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これはつまり「夏と冬どっち好きなん？」の質問には「冬やな」と答える結果になりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"長年にわたり答えを紛らわしてきたこの難問をクリア！！おめでとう！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanase.nishino/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/21/8770622/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問に答える。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"●○○の秋といえば、何を思い浮かべますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"食欲...芸術！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"●どいやさんってぬいぐるみにならないの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なったらいいですね(　・´ｰ・｀)あとペットボトルについてくるおまけとかいいですよね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"●オレンジとバナナどっちが好き？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"栄養があるバナナ！栄養！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポケモン再始動！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんやかんや倒して今からチャンピオンロードです。でも手持ちはブラッキー59ウィンディ59フライゴン53"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結局、育てたいと思うようなポケモンが出てこずこのバランス悪い3体ばっかり。やばいでーす(　・´ｰ・｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とりあえずゆっくり進めますえへ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanase.nishino/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/21/8770622/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お姉さんぶーん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んでいただいてありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も頑張りましょう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バイッッッ"}],"source":"archive"}